# YouAreUnstoppable

The unit is a day, not a habit. Streaks are derived from completed days.

Before API work, read `docs/domain.md`, `docs/implementation.md`, and `docs/auth-decisions.md`.

- Live routes are `GET /api/hello`, the `/api/auth/*` sign-in routes, and `GET /api/me`. Document a route only after the handler exists.
- A user has one subscription row via `users.subscription_id`. New accounts are `plan=free` and `role=user`.
- Do not call Stripe from auth. Checkout and webhooks are a later slice.
- `users.deleted_at` closes the account. Sign-in rejects a closed user. `subscriptions.deleted_reason` is set only with `deleted_at`.
- Google sign-in verifies an ID token against `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID` and links a verified email onto the existing user.
- The coach is short advice from identity and recent days, not a chat log.
- Free stays useful. Pro is $9.99/month and adds the full year, history, plans, and coach.
- Do not commit `.env` files or credentials.
